flowchart LR
  PC[Controller PC] --> IM[Instruction ROM: demo program]
  IM --> DEC[ADDI / LW / SW / EBREAK decoder]
  DEC --> RF[Register file: x0 held at zero]
  RF --> EA[Base + sign-extended immediate]
  EA --> DM[Independent data RAM]
  DEC --> CTRL[Read/write control]
  CTRL --> DM
  RF -->|store data| DM
  DM -->|load data| RF
  DEC -->|next PC / halt / fault| PC
